n": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 710380, "date": 1750118400, "platform": 130, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 757588, "date": 1750118400, "platform": 14, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1407592, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scu63s.jpg"}, {"id": 1407593, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scu63t.jpg"}, {"id": 1407589, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scu63p.jpg"}, {"id": 1407590, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scu63q.jpg"}, {"id": 1407591, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scu63r.jpg"}], "slug": "tron-catalyst", "storyline": "TRON: Catalyst pulls you back into the world of Disney\u2019s TRON to battle multiple opposing factions in the latest imaginative story from Bithell Games (Thomas Was Alone, Subsurface Circular, TRON: Identity). TRON: Catalyst is an all-new story-driven, isometric action adventure game, set in the immersive and diverse locations of the Arq Grid introduced in TRON: Identity.\n\nPlay as Exo, a highly resilient and resourceful program wielding an unexpected power known as the Glitch, gaining strength and abilities which the overlords of the Arq Grid\u2019s crumbling society seek to bring under control. Ride Light Cycles, engage in Identity Disc combat, and more as you\u2019re relentlessly pursued through the city and beyond by Conn, a malevolent program with an agenda of his own, while uncovering more about the glitches that threaten the stability of this world.", "summary": "The Arq Grid stands on the brink of collapse. With your Identity Disc and Light Cycle, fight to escape by wielding the power of the Glitch loop. Electrifying action and a rich story combine in a new adventure set within Disney\u2019s iconic TRON universe.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/tron-catalyst", "videos": [{"id": 141791, "name": "Release Date